        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0105_brother_09",
      "hash64": "0390D2B4896C8706",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]I knew it... You really are strong,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\r\\nHow\\r\\nam\\r\\nI\\r\\never\\r\\ngonna\\r\\nbe\\r\\nable\\r\\nto\\r\\nbeat\\r\\nyou?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
